{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex","content_id":"11b79618-67f5-49ee-ba83-38ac139080b6","description":"This consultation seeks views on the local government reorganisation proposals we have received from councils in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9408340","isbn":"","title":"Proposals for local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex/proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":448146,"filename":"East_Sussex_and_Brighton_and_Hove_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9408346","isbn":"","number_of_pages":34,"title":"East Sussex and Brighton and Hove: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a60cf3d34dfb74772f96d49/East_Sussex_and_Brighton_and_Hove_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on the proposals submitted by councils for the reorganisation of local government in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex.</p>\n\n<p>Responses to this consultation will inform our decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.</p>\n\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <h4 id=\"consultations-on-modified-proposals\">Consultations on modified proposals</h4>\n\n  <p>On 12 May 2026, we published 2 consultations on modified proposals for local government reorganisation in:</p>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove\">East Sussex and Brighton and Hove</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-west-sussex\">West Sussex</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Summary and analysis of responses for the part of the consultation covering East Sussex and Brighton and Hove added.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-22T15:06:08Z"},{"note":"Added link to consultation on modified proposals for local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-12T09:08:57Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-19T15:00:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-01-11T23:59:00.000+00:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9408340"],"final_outcome_attachments":["9408346"],"final_outcome_detail":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government has decided to implement, subject to Parliamentary approval, the proposal for 2 unitary councils to be established in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove.</p>\n\n<p>This proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>East Sussex County Council</li>\n  <li>Eastbourne Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Hastings Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Lewes District Council and</li>\n  <li>Rother District Council</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The Secretary of State will exercise the power to modify the proposal to achieve the boundary change requested by Brighton and Hove City Council, with the exception of Falmer Parish.</p>\n\n<h4 id=\"partial-response\">Partial Response</h4>\n\n<p>This consultation response summary is a partial response to the consultation. It provides a summary of the responses received on the proposals submitted by councils in the East Sussex and Brighton and Hove invitation area.</p>\n\n<p>No decision has yet been taken on local government reorganisation in West Sussex. A further response covering the responses to proposals submitted by councils in the West Sussex invitation area will be published once a decision has been taken.</p>\n</div>","first_public_at":"2025-11-19T15:00:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"opening_date":"2025-11-19T15:00:00.000+00:00","political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"consultation_outcome","first_published_at":"2025-11-19T15:00:03+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex","base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex","content_id":"11b79618-67f5-49ee-ba83-38ac139080b6","document_type":"consultation_outcome","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:06:08Z","schema_name":"consultation","title":"Local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisa